                <title><![CDATA[【Requests】[REQ AUD] - Prince - Purple Rain (First Pressing)]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/prince-purple-rain-first-pressing.294492/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					Does anyone have a CD or Vinyl Rip of the first US pressing in FLAC? I’m looking for the 1984 master. I heard that it’s brighter and punchier with more bass than the 24/192 HDTracks version already posted on here.<br>
<br>
If you have the BSM One-Step pressing that recently came out that would be even better, any version with the original 80s mastering works for me. Would love to listen to the original vision without any modern alternations. Thank you in advance!
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
                <author><![CDATA[user638479392]]></author>
